## 1. Product

A poultry-farm management app for a single farm ("Royo Farm", Uganda, currency UGX). Five things it does:

1. **Flocks** — batches of birds: placement date, birds placed, birds alive, mortality, survival %, age.
2. **Production** — daily eggs / broken eggs / birds lost / feed used per flock; logging mortality also decrements the flock's bird count.
3. **Money** — sales (eggs, live birds, manure, other) and expenses in 7 categories.
4. **Reporting** — 6-month revenue/expense/profit trend, next-month and next-3-month **profit forecast** (linear regression over monthly history), cost breakdown, eggs per month, profit per flock, CSV export.
5. **Inventory** — feed/medication/equipment stock, in/out movements, reorder alerts, stock value.

Two roles: **admin** (owner — full control, invites people) and **user** (staff — can add records, can only change/delete their own). Sign-in: email + password (with email verification) and Google. Nothing is public; signed-out users see nothing but the auth screens.

