## 9. Design

Reproduce this look — it is not a generic Material template.

| Token | Value | Use |
|---|---|---|
| background | warm off-white `#FAF7F1` | page background |
| card / surface | `#FFFFFF`, 1dp border `#E7E1D6`, 16dp radius, soft shadow | cards, panels |
| primary | deep forest green `#1E4A38` | primary buttons, positive figures, forecast card fill, active nav |
| onPrimary | `#FAF7F1` | text on green |
| accent | warm amber `#C4762A` | active-nav underline, small highlights, icons on green |
| destructive | brick red `#C1372F` | negative profit, low-stock badge |
| muted text | `#66756C` | captions, helper text |
| display type | a serif display face (`FontFamily.Serif` fallback) | page titles, stat values, big money |
| body type | humanist sans (default `SansSerif` / Roboto) | everything else |

Layout rules: cards with 20dp padding; 12–16dp gaps; stat grid 2 columns on phone, 4 on tablet (≥600dp); max content width ~1100dp centred; section headings are display-serif and slightly tracked; every list has a loading skeleton and an empty state with an icon + one-line CTA.

