## 12. Parity notes (deliberate gaps in the original)

- **Create + read only.** There is no edit or delete UI for flocks, production records, sales, expenses, items or movements, and no screen sets a flock to `closed` (the status field exists for reporting). Do not add those unless the user asks; the security rules already allow the creator/admin to edit if it is added later.
- Flock numbers change only through the production log; there is no manual "adjust birds" action.
- No notifications, no payments, no photos, no multi-farm, no currency switching, no i18n.
- Data is farm-wide: every member sees every record (the original design), so the app is **invite-only** — keep sign-up closed to strangers in Firebase (Auth settings or the "not registered" gate).

